sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Center Manager
    participant UI as API client
    participant API as Express API middleware
    participant S as operationHandlers
    participant DB as Prisma / PostgreSQL
    A->>UI: Submit creation form
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/slots
    activate API
    API->>API: authenticate, checkFacilityScope, authorize(ADMIN, MANAGER), validate request
    alt request rejected
        API-->>UI: 400 / 401 / 403
    else request accepted
        API->>S: operationHandlers POST /slots
        activate S
        S->>DB: slot.create(data with scoped facilityId)
        activate DB
        DB-->>S: Created entity or persistence error
        deactivate DB
        alt persistence fails
            S-->>API: Conflict or mapped database error
        else persistence succeeds
            S-->>API: Created entity
        end
        deactivate S
        API-->>UI: Creation response or mapped error
    end
    deactivate API
    UI-->>A: Show creation outcome
